This directory contains the Bison parser generator.Copy the files bison.simple and bison.hairy into/h0/LIBFor other directory's read the manual.Send bug reports to bug-gnu-utils@prep.ai.mit.edu.  Please include theversion number from `bison --version', and a complete, self-containedtest case in each bug report.Send bug reports (OSK only) to nobi@mcshh.hanse.de. Please include theversion number from --version, and a complete, self-contrained test casein each bug report.